Subject: [PATCH] docs(readme): name the Tormach post and machines; setup
 sheets export from the Setups page

The README listed six posts without Tormach PathPilot (#131) and said
the setup sheet and tool list print alongside a post, which Post never
did (#267). They export from the Setups page.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
